# The app keeping itself current (Updates.kt): a newer build in the local cloud's releases (release-seed: this APK as
# version 0.1.1), found by the core's app.update at the start; settings' 关于 row says 更新到 0.1.1; in 关于, its version
# row's button 更新到 0.1.1 pressed, it is downloaded, checked against its sha256 and handed to the system's installer,
# which asks the person to confirm.
#only android
#env MBUI_UPDATE_FEED=android
#before release-seed
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
# settings' home pushed in, then scrolled to its 关于 row (under the fold): dragged from 此设备 where the frame has it,
# as a person may while the page slides in (Android's list takes that drag: AnimatedContent holds no input back)
until 此设备
dragon 0 -500 400 此设备
until 更新到 0.1.1
shot 1-settings
tap 关于
until still.fail mbui
# the runner asked first to wait for the system's installer in front (the activity manager's top activity), keep its
# page and decline it: once the update is handed over, the installer's page covers the app, which draws no frame till
# it is back in front, so no step of the app's waits through that time
log do: android-installer
tap 更新到 0.1.1
# downloaded and checked (正在安装, before the build is handed over); then the runner's word that the installer came in
# front and was declined; the update's own end (handed to the installer: the host works at it no more), and the
# host's word that the app is shown again
until 正在安装
done 1-android-installer
outside_done an update downloading
shown
